WEBVTT

00:06:58.356 --> 00:07:02.596
of the world’s first
zero-emission construction site.

00:07:03.156 --> 00:07:05.836
The agency of urban environment

00:07:05.876 --> 00:07:10.716
was transforming a busy street

00:07:10.756 --> 00:07:15.276
into a pedestrian zone
in the city center of Oslo.

00:07:15.756 --> 00:07:21.836
They were using powerful machineries
to lift and break slabs of asphalt,

00:07:21.876 --> 00:07:24.876
even though the machinery was so quiet

00:07:24.876 --> 00:07:29.716
that the next door cafes and restaurants
kept their front doors open.